WEBVTT

00:01.701 --> 00:04.004
I'm Nina, 12 years old.

00:04.004 --> 00:07.064
I was just an ordinary
junior high school student, but...

00:08.008 --> 00:11.211
Since the day I accidentally swallowed
a ball called the Crystal Pearl,

00:11.211 --> 00:14.014
my life has changed pretty drastically.

00:14.014 --> 00:17.717
And the ball happened to be something
that's used for the sorcery test.

00:17.717 --> 00:22.355
The team of the two examinees,
which happens to possess that ball

00:22.355 --> 00:25.051
when the test ends, will pass the test
and become professional sorcerers!

00:27.027 --> 00:29.529
Does that mean I'm going to be
chased down by the examinees?!

00:29.529 --> 00:32.332
- Don't cry!
- I guess you have no choice
but to prepare yourself, Zero.

00:32.332 --> 00:33.333
Huh?

00:33.333 --> 00:35.035
There is only one way to do this.

00:35.035 --> 00:37.537
You will have to protect her
with everything you've got

00:37.537 --> 00:39.039
until the day that the test ends.

00:39.039 --> 00:41.841
Until the day the medicine is completed

00:41.841 --> 00:44.044
and you're able to remove
the Crystal Pearl from her body...

00:44.044 --> 00:46.046
We will protect her with our own hands!

00:46.046 --> 00:47.447
You mean her?!

00:47.447 --> 00:51.751
Me? These guys are going to protect me?

00:51.751 --> 00:54.354
Just like the princes
who bravely face the enemies

00:54.354 --> 00:56.956
no matter how ferocious they are,
and fight them for the people

00:56.956 --> 00:58.291
that they love and their own dreams...

00:58.291 --> 01:00.987
These two are going to protect me!

01:01.227 --> 01:13.673
One love! Two love? Three love! Four love?
One love! Two love? Three love! Come on!

01:13.673 --> 01:19.946
Here's what boys don't know.
Girls are moody.

01:19.946 --> 01:26.186
You're a sweet person
and it will be okay tomorrow.

01:26.186 --> 01:32.459
But I feel different today.
I want to go all out!

01:32.459 --> 01:37.556
Because I can't decide it just yet
I want everything

01:38.731 --> 01:45.071
The kinds of love are just like jewels.

01:45.071 --> 01:50.643
Each of them (Shining boys!) is sparkling.

01:50.643 --> 01:57.550
Yes!
They say there is only one true love

01:57.550 --> 02:03.890
But it's okay, we can decide
that at the very last moment

02:03.890 --> 02:10.130
That moment (Happiness)
I will protect it (Happiness)

02:10.130 --> 02:16.402
Come on, let's go find a poppin' heart

02:16.402 --> 02:22.642
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!

02:22.642 --> 02:27.773
My love! True love! Your love!
Pure love! My love! True love!

02:47.033 --> 02:50.036
Why does it have to be me
who gets chased down?

02:50.036 --> 02:53.494
Don't come! I said,
don't come! Don't come!

02:55.909 --> 02:58.411
No! Help me!

02:58.411 --> 03:00.572
Help me!

03:16.996 --> 03:18.998
Hurry up and get out
of the bed already, Nina!

03:18.998 --> 03:22.092
The alarm has been going off for a while.

03:41.154 --> 03:42.722
Hey, what did you do that for?!

03:42.722 --> 03:45.425
You pervert! Why are you in my room?

03:45.425 --> 03:46.025
Who are you calling a pervert?!

03:46.025 --> 03:47.026
Get out!

03:47.026 --> 03:50.430
Don't you come in
someone's room without permission!

03:50.430 --> 03:53.666
Stop it! Hey! Why, Nina?

03:53.666 --> 03:55.190
What are you doing?

03:56.669 --> 03:58.037
Oh, hey, Ichii.

03:58.037 --> 04:00.039
I came to get you since
you were taking so long.

04:00.039 --> 04:01.574
Huh? Came to get me?

04:01.574 --> 04:03.776
Remember, we told you
that we would protect you.

04:03.776 --> 04:05.945
So starting today, we will take you to
school and pick you up from school every day.

04:05.945 --> 04:07.213
Everyday zura!

04:07.213 --> 04:08.481
Everyday...

04:08.481 --> 04:10.350
Didn't you explain it to Nina-chan?

04:10.350 --> 04:13.219
Even if I wanted to explain it to her
she started hitting me all of a sudden!

04:13.219 --> 04:16.155
That was your fault! You're the one
who got on my bed all of a sudden!

04:16.155 --> 04:17.156
What did you say?

04:17.156 --> 04:18.958
Knock it off, Zero!

04:18.958 --> 04:22.962
Nina-chan, just come when you're
ready to go. I'll be waiting for you.

04:22.962 --> 04:24.097
Hey, come with me, Zero.

04:24.097 --> 04:25.298
You're going to pay for that, Nina!

04:25.298 --> 04:26.959
H-Hey, this is the second floor!

04:30.003 --> 04:34.565
Oh yeah, I forgot...
Zero and Ichii are sorcerers.

04:35.241 --> 04:40.838
"Abruptly, May We Join You?!"

04:43.483 --> 04:47.086
Wow, this is awesome! I guess you guys
aren't sorcerers for nothing, huh?

04:47.086 --> 04:48.955
This is far from ordinary!

04:48.955 --> 04:51.057
But we're still in training though.

04:51.057 --> 04:53.326
But we won't be in training for long!

04:53.326 --> 04:56.029
We will definitely become
professional sorcerers next year!

04:56.029 --> 04:59.198
And I will pursue my dream!

04:59.198 --> 05:01.634
But even if you don't
become a professional...

05:01.634 --> 05:04.604
Wouldn't that be good enough
if you could use magic like this?

05:04.604 --> 05:06.472
You just wouldn't understand it.

05:06.472 --> 05:09.142
Sure, whatever! I don't care!

05:09.142 --> 05:12.009
It's none of my business
what you're going to become anyway!

05:16.082 --> 05:17.150
That's...

05:17.150 --> 05:18.818
San and Forte!

05:18.818 --> 05:20.553
Good morning!

05:20.553 --> 05:22.989
We'll definitely catch
the Crystal Pearl today for sure!

05:22.989 --> 05:26.254
Today things aren't going
to be like the other day!

05:29.929 --> 05:32.124
Oh no... My body just did that on its own!

05:33.399 --> 05:34.491
Oh no, you don't!

05:36.202 --> 05:38.504
I want to join, too!

05:38.504 --> 05:42.201
Summoning magic! Air Fish!

05:43.609 --> 05:46.446
Go!

05:46.446 --> 05:48.948
No! Move! Don't eat me!

05:48.948 --> 05:50.450
Nina!

05:50.450 --> 05:52.008
Charm Capsule!

06:02.161 --> 06:03.429
Yes!

06:03.429 --> 06:06.592
Oh no, that's my fish!

06:09.369 --> 06:12.133
Nina! Nina!

06:13.740 --> 06:15.640
Nina!

06:19.312 --> 06:21.075
What's that?

06:25.084 --> 06:27.587
Shoot! We will make you pay for this!

06:27.587 --> 06:30.723
Bye! See you later!
We'll catch you later!

06:30.723 --> 06:33.659
So they're going to come back?!

06:33.659 --> 06:35.194
Of course they are.

06:35.194 --> 06:37.263
They will come over and over again
until the test is over zura.

06:37.263 --> 06:41.100
Actually, not just those two,
but a lot of people will come, I'm sure.

06:41.100 --> 06:43.302
Give me a break!

06:43.302 --> 06:47.006
Are you telling me that I'm going
to live like this until Christmas?!

06:47.006 --> 06:48.405
- Yes!
- Yes!

06:53.980 --> 06:55.782
- Good morning, Nina!
- Morning!

06:55.782 --> 06:58.451
Hey, hey, it was pretty
wild yesterday, huh, Nina?

06:58.451 --> 07:01.154
I couldn't believe a car fell
from the sky all of a sudden!

07:01.154 --> 07:03.322
They said that they were
shooting for a TV show.

07:03.322 --> 07:05.291
- Really?
- Yeah.

07:05.291 --> 07:07.226
So are you okay, Nina?

07:07.226 --> 07:10.763
Sure, I'm okay. Thank you
for worrying about me.

07:10.763 --> 07:13.800
Well, actually it's not okay...

07:13.800 --> 07:16.792
But I guess I could take a break
from them at school, right?

07:17.804 --> 07:20.973
Meet the transfer students,
Zero and Ichii.

07:20.973 --> 07:24.877
What?! Wh-Why are they here?!

07:24.877 --> 07:27.880
Ichii is two years
older than everyone here,

07:27.880 --> 07:29.916
but he was hospitalized
due to his illness,

07:29.916 --> 07:32.385
so he will be joining you guys
as a 7th grader.

07:32.385 --> 07:34.287
I hope to see you all get along with them.

07:34.287 --> 07:35.845
And also they will be sitting...

07:37.990 --> 07:40.993
Excuse me! I'd much rather
sit on the right side of Nina!

07:40.993 --> 07:45.498
Excuse me! I'd much rather sit
on the left side of Nina-san as well!

07:45.498 --> 07:47.366
- What?
- What?
- What?

07:47.366 --> 07:49.869
- Wait! Wait! What's going on, Nina?
- Wait! Wait! What's going on, Nina?

07:49.869 --> 07:52.405
Do you know those two guys?

07:52.405 --> 07:55.107
I don't know if I "know" them.
It's like...

07:55.107 --> 07:56.142
Those two are the ones from yesterday.

07:56.142 --> 07:57.410
Nina, explain what's going on here.

07:57.410 --> 07:59.212
Well, that's...

07:59.212 --> 08:00.012
Love, huh...

08:00.012 --> 08:02.674
Sir, what are you
mumbling random stuff for?!

08:03.649 --> 08:05.918
...Therefore, Akiko Yosano is...

08:05.918 --> 08:09.121
- Hey, Zero! Ichii!
Why did you come to school?
- Akiko Yosano.

08:09.121 --> 08:10.990
They don't care if
it's a school or wherever,

08:10.990 --> 08:12.758
those examinees would
come attack you anywhere!

08:12.758 --> 08:15.795
Zero and I will be your bodyguards even
inside the school, so you can rest assured.

08:15.795 --> 08:16.963
But still...

08:16.963 --> 08:19.298
Their stares... Their stares...

08:19.298 --> 08:22.825
Their stares! Their stares!
Their stares! Their stares!

08:23.503 --> 08:25.095
...They're so piercing...

08:29.976 --> 08:31.944
Hey, wait a minute! Wait a minute!
What are you doing?

08:31.944 --> 08:33.513
We have to go to a different room.

08:33.513 --> 08:35.114
Where is the chemical lab?

08:35.114 --> 08:36.582
Oh, it's right here.

08:36.582 --> 08:38.818
It's right here.

08:38.818 --> 08:40.453
All right, Nina-chan.
You sit right here.

08:40.453 --> 08:41.988
Well, sit here, Nina.

08:41.988 --> 08:42.989
I'll sit here.

08:42.989 --> 08:43.990
I sit here.

08:43.990 --> 08:46.292
- Hey!
- They are our...

08:46.292 --> 08:49.161
Sorry, but would you mind
sitting across the table from us?

08:49.161 --> 08:50.029
Because...

08:50.029 --> 08:52.932
- The seats next to Nina-chan
are reserved for us!
- Wha...

08:52.932 --> 08:54.133
There you have it!

08:54.133 --> 08:55.067
- What?!
- What?!

08:55.067 --> 08:56.035
- What?!
- What?!

08:56.035 --> 08:57.003
- What?!
- What?!

08:57.003 --> 09:01.007
Hey, did you hear about it?
Those three are engaged!

09:01.007 --> 09:04.677
Supposedly those two guys have transferred
to this school, chasing after Nina.

09:04.677 --> 09:09.749
Oh... That's why those three are
always together... That explains.

09:09.749 --> 09:11.717
What the heck is this situation?

09:11.717 --> 09:14.413
What the heck is this?!

09:17.189 --> 09:20.626
Seriously, can't you stay away from me
a little at least when I'm walking?!

09:20.626 --> 09:22.695
I'm sorry, but we should stay
as close as possible to you

09:22.695 --> 09:23.963
since we're your bodyguards and all.

09:23.963 --> 09:26.132
But this looks totally weird!

09:26.132 --> 09:29.835
Stop complaining! This is your fault
for swallowing the Crystal Pearl anyway!

09:29.835 --> 09:32.738
What's your problem? It's not like
I swallowed it because I wanted to!

09:32.738 --> 09:35.408
And we're not protecting you
because we want to, either!

09:35.408 --> 09:38.878
Then are you protecting me
only against your will?!

09:38.878 --> 09:41.047
That's not how it is, but we're just
saying that it's hard to protect you

09:41.047 --> 09:42.381
unless we stay close to you, that's all!

09:42.381 --> 09:45.084
At any rate, do not stray
away from us! Got it?

09:45.084 --> 09:47.553
Geez! Stop bossing me around!

09:47.553 --> 09:49.088
- Nina-chan!
- Nina!

09:49.088 --> 09:52.615
Come back here! You never know
when they're going to... Nina!

09:54.360 --> 09:58.531
But you know what? I do understand
why she's so upset.

09:58.531 --> 10:00.866
It's only natural for a person
to feel uncomfortable

10:00.866 --> 10:04.170
when he or she gets followed around
like this all the time.

10:04.170 --> 10:05.571
I understand...

10:05.571 --> 10:08.274
But we can't leave her alone just because
we understand what it's like, can we?

10:08.274 --> 10:13.746
We won't be able to remove the Crystal Pearl
until the end of this year, Christmas.

10:13.746 --> 10:15.214
There are a bunch of them
among those examinees

10:15.214 --> 10:20.119
who would harm Nina and try to
remove the Crystal Pearl by force!

10:20.119 --> 10:23.823
If that ever happens, Nina, who's not
capable of using magic will be...

10:23.823 --> 10:27.893
That's why we have no choice but to protect
Nina until the medicine is completed!

10:27.893 --> 10:29.428
I don't care if she hates us or whatever.

10:29.428 --> 10:31.297
We have no choice but
to stay close to Nina!

10:31.297 --> 10:32.365
You're right!

10:32.365 --> 10:33.354
Yeah!

10:34.066 --> 10:36.836
H-Hey, what are you doing, Ichii, Zero?!

10:36.836 --> 10:42.035
I told you to stay away from me, didn't I?
Let me down! Zero, Ichii!

10:43.542 --> 10:44.810
What should we do?

10:44.810 --> 10:47.580
This is frustrating, but I guess
we can't do anything as long as

10:47.580 --> 10:49.982
those guys are staying close
to the Crystal Pearl, huh?

10:49.982 --> 10:53.152
Fo-chan, I have a good idea!

10:53.152 --> 10:55.388
What? Are you sure, San?

10:55.388 --> 10:59.225
Yup! Let me handle it!
I'm sure it'll look great on you!

10:59.225 --> 11:01.159
"Look good on me"?

11:15.341 --> 11:17.043
Hey, San...

11:17.043 --> 11:20.046
What is it, Fo-chan?

11:20.046 --> 11:21.681
Hey, San...

11:21.681 --> 11:24.083
What is it, Fo-chan?

11:24.083 --> 11:25.751
Why am I dressed up as a girl?

11:25.751 --> 11:27.553
Huh? Because you're going
to attack Nina-chan

11:27.553 --> 11:29.355
when she lets her guard down
in the bathroom, right?

11:29.355 --> 11:32.158
- Of course you have to dress up
like a girl for that, Fo-chan!
- Err...

11:32.158 --> 11:33.859
I don't know why, but for some reason
I can't help thinking that you're about

11:33.859 --> 11:36.629
to trick me into something!
But do you think it's just me, San?

11:36.629 --> 11:38.264
- Hey, check it out.
- Eek!

11:38.264 --> 11:40.633
Aren't they extremely cute or what?

11:40.633 --> 11:43.035
She's boyish and skinny, too!

11:43.035 --> 11:45.971
That one with the blonde hair
is totally my type!

11:45.971 --> 11:48.708
Damn it! I'm going to hurry up
and get the Crystal Pearl

11:48.708 --> 11:50.876
and get out of a place like this quick!

11:50.876 --> 11:52.778
Wow, you're so popular, Fo-chan!

11:52.778 --> 11:54.513
Be quiet, San! Let's go!

11:54.513 --> 11:57.880
Roger that, Fo-chan!
I'm coming with you!

11:59.785 --> 12:02.655
Cripes! Zero and Ichii,
stop following me!

12:02.655 --> 12:04.757
You just don't get it, do you?

12:04.757 --> 12:07.059
We told you we couldn't
protect you unless we're with you.

12:07.059 --> 12:11.697
Yeah, I understand that! But you don't
have to watch me all day long, do you?

12:11.697 --> 12:14.333
We have been the center of attention!
Center of attention!

12:14.333 --> 12:19.805
Hmm... That's a problem. I wish
there was some other way to do this.

12:19.805 --> 12:21.373
I'm sorry, Nina-chan.

12:21.373 --> 12:25.144
Anyway this is embarrassing,
so stay away from me a little, Zero.

12:25.144 --> 12:26.270
And you, too, Ichii.

12:28.347 --> 12:29.609
- Nina!
- Nina-chan!

12:34.220 --> 12:35.949
Are you okay?

12:42.628 --> 12:45.290
Are you okay, Nina-chan?

12:47.533 --> 12:50.024
I-I'm fine, Ichii! Thanks!

12:54.473 --> 12:59.378
Oh my goodness... I can't believe this.
My heart is still pounding.

12:59.378 --> 13:01.312
Is it possible that the dream was...

13:03.015 --> 13:06.951
The one who protected me in my dream was...

13:07.520 --> 13:08.988
Ichii?

13:08.988 --> 13:11.513
- Was it Ichii?
- Are you okay, Nina-chan?

13:12.658 --> 13:14.260
- Hey, Nina!
- Hey, Nina!
- Hey, Nina!

13:14.260 --> 13:15.761
- What's going on with you and those two?
- Huh?

13:15.761 --> 13:16.996
- What is your relationship with them?
- Umm...

13:16.996 --> 13:18.597
- Boyfriend?
- Love-triangle?

13:18.597 --> 13:19.532
Do you know their cell phone numbers?

13:19.532 --> 13:21.000
Does your ribbon have wires inside?

13:21.000 --> 13:23.901
- Hey, Nina! Hey! Hey!
- Hey, Nina! Hey! Hey!
- Hey, Nina! Hey! Hey!

13:26.806 --> 13:30.042
This is a perfect example
of the moth flying into the flame!

13:30.042 --> 13:31.844
Crystal Pearl!

13:31.844 --> 13:33.312
Y-You guys are...

13:33.312 --> 13:35.075
San and Forte!

13:36.282 --> 13:38.113
I had no idea...

13:39.752 --> 13:43.122
I really had no idea...

13:43.122 --> 13:44.523
What are you talking about?

13:44.523 --> 13:47.660
I thought you were a boy, Fo-chan,
but I guess you are a girl...

13:47.660 --> 13:49.695
Y-You're wrong! Don't get the wrong idea!

13:49.695 --> 13:54.500
I only dressed up like this to capture you!
Therefore I am a respectable man!

13:54.500 --> 13:55.568
What? Man?!

13:55.568 --> 13:56.569
Man?!

13:56.569 --> 13:58.230
Man?!

14:01.874 --> 14:04.410
Peeping Tom! Pervert!

14:04.410 --> 14:05.578
What the heck was he thinking about,

14:05.578 --> 14:07.780
coming in here being
dressed up like a girl?!

14:07.780 --> 14:10.482
Grrr! I'm so annoyed!
He was actually cuter than me!

14:10.482 --> 14:13.686
I'm sure he hasn't gone too far yet!
I swear I'll end his life!

14:13.686 --> 14:16.155
Wait! Huh?

14:16.155 --> 14:18.958
That's Ichii-sama and Zero-sama!

14:18.958 --> 14:20.259
What is your hobby?

14:20.259 --> 14:21.694
What kind of girl do you like?

14:21.694 --> 14:22.695
Do you have a girlfriend?

14:22.695 --> 14:23.729
Can I have your cell phone number?

14:23.729 --> 14:25.197
Let's get together
and have a party! Party!

14:25.197 --> 14:26.357
Can I go out with you?

14:27.766 --> 14:30.894
Z-Zero, let's get out of here for now!

14:36.942 --> 14:39.843
Wait! Ichii-sama! Zero-sama!

14:42.014 --> 14:46.075
All right, I should get out of here
while I can, too...

14:50.356 --> 14:54.460
That's called an air fish!
It's a fish, but it's a carnivore,

14:54.460 --> 14:57.088
so it might eat people
and stuff like that, too!

14:59.832 --> 15:06.005
Fo-chan is being chased right now!
So why don't we play tag, too?

15:06.005 --> 15:08.641
What kind of reason is that?
Stop it! Don't follow me!

15:08.641 --> 15:11.633
Help me, Zero! Ichii!

15:13.112 --> 15:16.048
Come on, guys, please calm down,
okay! Okay!

15:16.048 --> 15:17.917
Then please don't try to run away
and just answer our questions!

15:17.917 --> 15:19.885
What kind of girl do you like?

15:19.885 --> 15:21.320
Do you have a girlfriend?

15:21.320 --> 15:22.922
What is your cell phone number?

15:22.922 --> 15:24.023
Well, that's...

15:24.023 --> 15:25.820
I told you to get out of my way!

15:26.892 --> 15:30.996
Wow, that was great! We love
how wild you are, Zero-sama!

15:30.996 --> 15:33.699
H-How did you reach
that conclusion?! All of you!

15:33.699 --> 15:36.035
Zero, look zura!

15:36.035 --> 15:37.336
That!

15:37.336 --> 15:38.803
Nina is...

15:41.573 --> 15:43.876
Damn it! That San!

15:43.876 --> 15:45.366
Move! Move! I said move!

15:47.513 --> 15:50.416
Are you hurt? I'm sorry that he's so rough.

15:50.416 --> 15:56.121
But he's not a bad person,
so please forgive him.

15:56.121 --> 15:58.681
Are you okay?

16:01.193 --> 16:04.763
Yes, Ichii-sama! I'm perfectly fine!

16:04.763 --> 16:06.966
- We're perfectly fine!
- We're perfectly fine!
- We're perfectly fine!

16:06.966 --> 16:11.337
- We're perfectly fine! Ichii-sama!
- We're perfectly fine! Ichii-sama!
- We're perfectly fine! Ichii-sama!

16:11.337 --> 16:13.772
Please someone! I can't take this!

16:13.772 --> 16:17.376
Go, go, go! Get her!

16:17.376 --> 16:20.279
Go, go, go!

16:20.279 --> 16:22.076
I won't let you do that!

16:27.619 --> 16:30.956
You knucklehead! That's why I told you
not to stray away from us!

16:30.956 --> 16:32.191
Who are you calling knucklehead anyway?

16:32.191 --> 16:34.493
I had to deal with
certain circumstances, too!

16:34.493 --> 16:36.662
Who gives a damn about
your circumstances? Idiot!

16:36.662 --> 16:38.530
Do not call me idiot!

16:38.530 --> 16:42.001
I'll call you that as many times as you
want me to! Idiot! Idiot! Idiot! Idiot!

16:42.001 --> 16:43.936
Idiot! Idiot! Idiot!

16:43.936 --> 16:47.573
You two, it's not the time to be arguing!
See, look at that zura!

16:47.573 --> 16:48.562
What?

16:49.875 --> 16:57.441
Ta-da! This is my second troupe!
Knap, knap, knap, knappy! Let's go!

16:58.717 --> 17:00.480
Oh no, you don't!

17:02.221 --> 17:03.555
Here comes the third troupe!

17:03.555 --> 17:05.250
Stop messing with me!

17:05.958 --> 17:07.459
The fourth troupe!

17:07.459 --> 17:08.794
This is...

17:08.794 --> 17:10.295
The fifth troupe!

17:10.295 --> 17:11.363
Nothing!

17:11.363 --> 17:14.700
I'm not done yet! The sixth troupe!

17:14.700 --> 17:15.968
If that's the case...

17:15.968 --> 17:17.993
What do you think of this?

17:25.677 --> 17:29.014
Don't you think I'm amazing?

17:29.014 --> 17:31.583
I have a whole lot more for you,

17:31.583 --> 17:35.521
but are you tired now from shooting
all the fireballs back-to-back?

17:35.521 --> 17:36.522
No big deal!

17:36.522 --> 17:39.058
All right! Then this should
be no big deal, either, right?

17:39.058 --> 17:40.685
Take that!

17:42.828 --> 17:44.129
Nina!

17:44.129 --> 17:45.164
Nina!

17:45.164 --> 17:46.722
I won't let you do that!

17:50.969 --> 17:53.505
Oh no, Zero! Are you hurt?

17:53.505 --> 17:55.407
Stop screaming! It's nothing!

17:55.407 --> 17:56.775
But you're bleeding!

17:56.775 --> 17:58.010
This is...

17:58.010 --> 17:59.778
Nothing!

17:59.778 --> 18:05.517
Why do you protect Nina-chan, Zero?
What you want is the Crystal Pearl, right?

18:05.517 --> 18:07.519
So you shouldn't care about Nina-chan...

18:07.519 --> 18:08.821
Whatever I do is my business!

18:08.821 --> 18:10.122
That's strange!

18:10.122 --> 18:13.192
If you hurried up and stole
the Crystal Pearl from Nina-chan

18:13.192 --> 18:15.527
you shouldn't have had
to get injured like that.

18:15.527 --> 18:18.664
Geez, that's enough of your complaints!

18:18.664 --> 18:22.801
I've already decided that
I am going to protect Nina! I am!

18:22.801 --> 18:24.169
Zero...

18:24.169 --> 18:26.805
I'm going to protect you!

18:26.805 --> 18:30.275
I see! I guess it's time for me
to give you the final blow.

18:30.275 --> 18:32.377
Knap! Ya!

18:32.377 --> 18:33.712
San, why you...

18:33.712 --> 18:35.373
I've had enough of you!

18:43.655 --> 18:45.418
Destruction magic!

18:55.400 --> 18:57.925
Magic Cannon!

19:03.976 --> 19:05.739
Wow, that's great!

19:07.412 --> 19:11.617
But no matter how hard you try
I can still give you more of them!

19:11.617 --> 19:12.518
Here you go!

19:12.518 --> 19:14.153
Humph, you fell for it!

19:14.153 --> 19:15.320
Huh?

19:15.320 --> 19:17.923
This is the curtain of smoke
that I made using the explosions.

19:17.923 --> 19:20.559
What I was really after was this!

19:20.559 --> 19:22.083
Give it back!

19:23.295 --> 19:27.633
You idiot! As long as I have this wand,
the ball is in my court!

19:27.633 --> 19:30.135
Don't you think you got a little
carried away with your mischief, San?

19:30.135 --> 19:31.603
That wasn't mischief.

19:31.603 --> 19:32.638
What?

19:32.638 --> 19:34.503
That was not mischief!

19:35.841 --> 19:36.708
F-Forte?!

19:36.708 --> 19:38.510
Both San and I are serious!

19:38.510 --> 19:41.613
We would do anything to
become professional sorcerers!

19:41.613 --> 19:44.149
We could even attack you
with that weary body!

19:44.149 --> 19:46.118
But Forte...

19:46.118 --> 19:48.353
When you try to intimidate me
in that outfit it's really...

19:48.353 --> 19:51.523
Shut up! I hope you're ready for this!

19:51.523 --> 19:52.457
San!

19:52.457 --> 20:01.533
Okay! It's my turn again!
Summoning magic! Big air fish! Go!

20:01.533 --> 20:03.000
It's gonna get Nina?

20:04.203 --> 20:06.505
Nina! Here comes more!

20:06.505 --> 20:08.097
Flames, come forth!

20:17.115 --> 20:18.207
Zero!

20:19.885 --> 20:20.919
Ichii!

20:20.919 --> 20:23.717
Defense magic! Crystal Barrier!

20:25.324 --> 20:26.959
Forte!

20:26.959 --> 20:32.531
No matter what kind of method you use
we will take you on! To protect Nina!

20:32.531 --> 20:34.021
Defense magic!!

20:36.702 --> 20:38.670
Reflecting Tornado!

21:00.292 --> 21:04.029
- You will pay for this!
- Nina-chan, let's play together again!

21:04.029 --> 21:06.190
Bye now!

21:10.335 --> 21:12.037
- Nina, are you all right?
- Nina-chan, are you all right?

21:12.037 --> 21:16.508
Oh, I'm fine, but Zero is hurt! He is!

21:16.508 --> 21:18.677
Ichii, you took too long to show up!

21:18.677 --> 21:20.545
I'm sorry. I thought you should be able

21:20.545 --> 21:22.714
to handle the opponents
at that level by yourself,

21:22.714 --> 21:24.149
but I guess you still have
a long way to go, huh?

21:24.149 --> 21:25.484
Long way to go zura!

21:25.484 --> 21:27.008
Well, let me see that.

21:28.820 --> 21:33.492
Zero still protected me, even though
he sustained an injury like that...

21:33.492 --> 21:35.827
An injury like that...

21:35.827 --> 21:37.124
Zero...

21:40.599 --> 21:42.897
I'm going to protect you!

21:44.836 --> 21:51.810
Zero is obnoxious, but maybe
he is a good person.

21:51.810 --> 21:55.180
Ouch! That hurt, Ichii! Owww!

21:55.180 --> 21:57.382
Owwwww!!!

21:57.382 --> 21:59.475
Zero is...

22:02.020 --> 22:04.990
Hey, Nina! Where have you been?!

22:04.990 --> 22:07.926
You have to see this! Isn't that crazy!

22:07.926 --> 22:08.827
- Oh...
- Oh...
- Oh...

22:08.827 --> 22:10.362
There were some kind
of mysterious explosions.

22:10.362 --> 22:11.630
The entire school was in panic!

22:11.630 --> 22:15.067
We had people from fire dept. and police.
It was totally chaotic!

22:15.067 --> 22:18.127
Zero... I need to talk to you later.

22:20.005 --> 22:21.673
What's so funny?!

22:21.673 --> 22:23.300
Nothing!

22:25.010 --> 22:27.579
Zura, zura! You're going
to get yelled at by Ichii!

22:27.579 --> 22:28.814
What did you say?

22:28.814 --> 22:30.577
Zura, zura!

22:35.253 --> 22:36.488
I'm home!

22:36.488 --> 22:37.978
Welcome back!

22:39.358 --> 22:40.892
What?

22:40.892 --> 22:44.096
What is the meaning of this?
What are you two doing in my room?

22:44.096 --> 22:47.666
Oh, we decided to live
in this room starting today!

22:47.666 --> 22:48.997
Say what?!

22:49.701 --> 22:53.071
In other words I extended this closet
with some magical space

22:53.071 --> 22:55.040
and created a room for Zero and I.

22:55.040 --> 22:57.876
People can't see it from outside
so don't worry about it.

22:57.876 --> 22:59.144
Why?

22:59.144 --> 23:02.514
After all, we feel comfortable if we
could stay as close as possible to you.

23:02.514 --> 23:04.716
If you think about a "what if" situation.

23:04.716 --> 23:07.919
Anyway this closet is the only place
we can go in and out of the room, right?

23:07.919 --> 23:12.324
So whenever we go outside
we'll have to go through your room zura.

23:12.324 --> 23:15.350
- So here we are, Nina!
- So here we are, Nina!
- So here we are, Nina-chan!

23:16.661 --> 23:20.766
Don't worry. We moved all your clothes that
were in the closet to the room over here.

23:20.766 --> 23:22.701
So if you need them,
come and get them, okay?

23:22.701 --> 23:26.838
Th-This is a nightmare!
How could this happen?

23:26.838 --> 23:30.409
What's going to happen to my life now?

23:30.409 --> 23:34.004
You have nothing to worry about!
We will keep the closet closed.

23:35.147 --> 23:37.581
That's not the problem here!

23:44.222 --> 23:47.325
Pit-a-pat, skip! Parallel pop!

23:47.325 --> 23:53.321
Pit-a-pat, step! Miracle kiss!
Pit-a-pat, magical! Lollipop!

24:01.740 --> 24:07.712
My heart is beating so fast.
He might notice.

24:07.712 --> 24:13.585
My heart is pounding and throbbing.
It feels like it's going to burst.

24:13.585 --> 24:19.458
No matter which direction I look,
his eyes are crystals.

24:19.458 --> 24:25.330
They are so brilliant
that I just look away.

24:25.330 --> 24:31.169
The seed of love has begun to sprout.
Even my magic, too! Check it out!

24:31.169 --> 24:37.768
They will keep on growing
and spinning and explode!

24:39.811 --> 24:45.484
Popping lollipop. Save me, lollipop!
Throbbing heart.

24:45.484 --> 24:51.690
Two candies, I can't decide
which one is better.

24:51.690 --> 24:57.529
Even the earth turns the other way,
if you hold me,

24:57.529 --> 25:03.368
the shape of my heart will
change just like pit-a-pat!

25:03.368 --> 25:09.307
The shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat! Lollipop!

25:11.676 --> 25:13.311
My name is Nina Yamada!

25:13.311 --> 25:15.647
An ordinary junior high student! But...

25:15.647 --> 25:18.984
Why do I have to deal with all this
even when I'm at school?!

25:18.984 --> 25:21.052
Hey, Nina! Where are you?

25:21.052 --> 25:23.255
That's strange. She's nowhere to be found!

25:23.255 --> 25:24.456
Booboo!

25:24.456 --> 25:27.084
Hey, Ichii! There's a baby
at a place like this!

25:28.560 --> 25:30.790
You're a good baby, so don't cry, okay?

25:31.930 --> 25:35.991
Next time on Save Me! Lollipop
"Kiss? Baby? Lollipop!?"
